            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Cua",
            "review_text": "hippokathy88\nPerth, Australia172 contributions\n0\nNothing special about this place, moving right along\nSep 2017 • Solo\nI was craving for some crab udon soup so decided to pay this place a visit. I got here around 7pm but they ran out of prawns so they gave me 2 crab cakes instead. Udon soup is pretty average here, the soup itself is too sweet. There was a good amount of crab meat but heaps of shells got mixed in. Nothing special about this place, moving right along!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 12, 2017",
